Description: "Bistro" ported to Convoy SN8F5701 8x7135 driver
  Full details at BLF and GitHub:
  https://budgetlightforum.com/t/bistrosn-a-port-of-bistro-firmware-to-convoy-sn8f5701-8x7135-driver/231645
